    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-trigger-intro",
        "moduleId": "trigger-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "触发器概述",
        "markdown": "触发器（trigger）是用户定义在关系表上的一类由事件驱动的特殊过程。一旦定义，任何用户对表的增、删、改操作均由服务器自动激活相应的触发器，在DBMS核心层进行集中的完整性控制。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000342"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "触发器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6338,
              "lineEnd": 6343,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "4b45871307bf4c20a8df3f0db0f460def0ec30b00f4d36729812975c1d19301d"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-trigger-define",
        "moduleId": "trigger-concept",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "触发器定义语法",
        "markdown": "SQL使用CREATE TRIGGER命令建立触发器，其一般格式为：\n\n```sql\nCREATE TRIGGER <触发器名>\n{BEFORE | AFTER} <触发事件> ON <表名>\nREFERENCING NEW|OLD ROW AS <变量>\nFOR EACH {ROW | STATEMENT}\n[WHEN <触发条件>]\n<触发动作体>\n```",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000343"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "数据库完整性",
                "定义触发器"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6344,
              "lineEnd": 6347,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "3826c0c0389f9be566606fb505c356ad673847dcff010ced05346774e6c18498"
            },
            {
              "materialId": "doc-8786f8dd100c0d7af2538e79",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000344"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
